        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9027/254, 10 Inch Cabinet Bar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA no frills pull that is elegant and modern, the 10 Inch Cabinet Handle is available in 6 beautiful finishes. Its contemporary shape makes it a great addition to any modern home, making it perfect for your kitchen remodel. The 10 Inch Cabinet Bar Pull is a statement piece, its longer length means that it will stand out, even on bigger cabinets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9027\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-long-cabinet-handle-omnia-9027-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9027 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
